asset:        styles.aep
title:        After Effects project fixture (combined): the layer style cases, the Curves and Mesh Warp effect cases 963, 964 and 985 and the text cases 340 and 734
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-28 by vangel76
notes:        Generated from scratch by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026, driven by the generator in `tests/fixtures/tools/` (one composition per case, named like the case; tests/fixtures/CASES.md), as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. Layer styles cannot be added by script: the contributor's earlier single-case files with the style defaults (951, 952, 955, 959, 960) and the presets base (984) were merged into the project by After Effects and each case comp is a duplicate of one of them with the case's changes set by script; 963, 964 and 985 apply animation presets the contributor made by hand in After Effects. Cases 988 (a Drop Shadow switched off: saved by After Effects from case 952 with the style's switch flag set to 0 in a copy) and 734 (one same-length edit of a text slot by the contributor) are the earlier single-case files merged in. The footage links name contributor-made test media that are not included (a png image); their stored paths and the host name were replaced by neutral ones of the same length. The XMP packet after the project container was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project.
